# ⌨️ Typing Speed Tester Pro

A modern desktop application that measures typing speed, accuracy, and errors using Python. Built with a clean CustomTkinter interface and SQLite database support.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🚀 Modern CustomTkinter GUI
- ⏱️ Live typing timer
- 📊 Words Per Minute (WPM) calculation
- 🎯 Accuracy calculation
- ❌ Error counting
- 💾 SQLite database for saving results
- 📋 Dashboard with test history
- 🟢 Easy Mode
- 🟡 Medium Mode
- 🔴 Hard Mode

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python 3
- CustomTkinter
- SQLite3
- Matplotlib

---

