├── dashboard.py
├── database.py
├── passages.py
├── utils.py
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
└── .gitignore
```

---

## 🚀 Installation

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/jani2496/Typing-Speed-Tester-Pro.git
```

### 2. Open the project

```bash
cd Typing-Speed-Tester-Pro
```

### 3. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Run the application

```bash
python main.py
```

